# Tool Station
item.tconspartan.dagger.name=Dagger
item.tconspartan.dagger.desc=A short, quick blade. Deals extra damage when striking from behind.\nHold right-click to throw it.
item.tconspartan.parrying_dagger.name=Parrying Dagger
item.tconspartan.parrying_dagger.desc=An off-hand blade made for defence.\nHold right-click to parry melee attacks.
item.tconspartan.katana.name=Katana
item.tconspartan.katana.desc=A swift curved sword. Sweeps, and hits harder against foes without a chestplate.\nBest wielded with both hands.
item.tconspartan.saber.name=Saber
item.tconspartan.saber.desc=A cavalry sword with a sweeping strike. Absorbs part of the melee damage you take while held.
item.tconspartan.spear.name=Spear
item.tconspartan.spear.desc=Keeps enemies at a distance thanks to its extended reach.
item.tconspartan.mace.name=Mace
item.tconspartan.mace.desc=A flanged club that is especially effective against the undead.
item.tconspartan.quarterstaff.name=Quarterstaff
item.tconspartan.quarterstaff.desc=A fast two-handed staff with a half-damage sweep.\nThe head material caps the top end, the binding the bottom end.
item.tconspartan.throwing_knife.name=Throwing Knife
item.tconspartan.throwing_knife.desc=A stack of 16 throwing knives. Hold right-click and release to throw one.\nPicked-up knives go back into their stack.
item.tconspartan.throwing_axe.name=Throwing Axe
item.tconspartan.throwing_axe.desc=A stack of 8 throwing axes. Hold right-click and release to throw one.\nPicked-up axes go back into their stack.
item.tconspartan.javelin.name=Javelin
item.tconspartan.javelin.desc=A bundle of 4 javelins dealing heavy damage when thrown.\nPicked-up javelins go back into their bundle.
item.tconspartan.boomerang.name=Boomerang
item.tconspartan.boomerang.desc=Hold right-click and release to throw it: it comes back to you after hitting something.

# Tool Forge
item.tconspartan.pike.name=Pike
item.tconspartan.pike.desc=A very long two-handed spear with greatly extended reach.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.lance.name=Lance
item.tconspartan.lance.desc=A cavalry weapon with extended reach. Deals extra damage while riding.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.glaive.name=Glaive
item.tconspartan.glaive.desc=A bladed polearm with extended reach and a half-damage sweep.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.greatsword.name=Greatsword
item.tconspartan.greatsword.desc=A massive two-handed sword. Extended reach, and its sweep deals full damage.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.halberd.name=Halberd
item.tconspartan.halberd.desc=A heavy two-handed polearm with extended reach. Disables shields.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.battle_axe.name=Battleaxe
item.tconspartan.battle_axe.desc=A heavy two-handed axe that also chops wood.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.warhammer.name=Warhammer
item.tconspartan.warhammer.desc=Its spike crushes through armour: part of the damage ignores it.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.battle_hammer.name=Battle Hammer
item.tconspartan.battle_hammer.desc=A slow, crushing hammer that knocks enemies back and leaves them dazed.\nRequires the Tool Forge.
item.tconspartan.war_scythe.name=War Scythe
item.tconspartan.war_scythe.desc=A reaping weapon with a wide sweep. Hits harder against foes without a helmet.\nRequires the Tool Forge.

